  <artifactId>bdi-test-oidc</artifactId>
  <name>Starter: bdi-test-oidc</name>
  <description>A Keycloak look-alike for tests (WireMock OIDC server of quarkus-test-oidc-server): a test resource that plays the platform's realm and returns the bdi-config-security-oidc keys, and a token factory that mints RHBK-shaped access tokens (preferred_username, realm_access.roles). Add with test scope.</description>

